<title>BELGIUM: SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT BELGIUM 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-NETHERLANDS BEAT BELGIUM 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Netherlands beat Belgium 3-0 (halftime 2-0) in a World Cup European group seven qualifier in Brussels on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Dennis Bergkamp 25, Clarence Seedorf 29, Wim Jonk 90 penalty.</p>
<p>Attendance: 36,500</p>
